WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.134 --> 00:00:22.287
Rat and Mole waved at ducks from the riverbank.

2
00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:26.738
"Rowing and swimming are great fun," Mole said.

3
00:00:26.739 --> 00:00:30.249
Mole felt like an expert now.

4
00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:34.621
"Here is a poem for the ducks!" said Rat.

5
00:00:34.622 --> 00:00:39.015
Ducks can swim on the river,

6
00:00:39.016 --> 00:00:42.764
Ducks can swim on the sea,

7
00:00:42.765 --> 00:00:47.098
Ducks can swim most anywhere,

8
00:00:47.099 --> 00:00:52.273
But not in an apple tree.

9
00:00:52.274 --> 00:00:58.348
"I don't like your poem much," said Mole, smiling.

10
00:00:58.349 --> 00:01:02.548
The ducks stuck their heads under the water.

11
00:01:02.549 --> 00:01:09.694
"The ducks don't either!" laughed Rat.

12
00:01:09.695 --> 00:01:13.101
"I was wondering," said Mole.

13
00:01:13.102 --> 00:01:15.572
"Could I meet Toad?"

14
00:01:15.573 --> 00:01:19.031
"What a great idea!" Rat said.

15
00:01:19.032 --> 00:01:22.629
"We'll paddle right there!"

16
00:01:22.630 --> 00:01:26.026
Mole untied the boat.

17
00:01:26.027 --> 00:01:30.403
Rat rowed them down the river.

18
00:01:30.404 --> 00:01:34.823
"Toad must be very nice," said Mole.

19
00:01:34.824 --> 00:01:39.099
"He is very friendly," said Rat.

20
00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:42.182
"But not too clever."

21
00:01:42.183 --> 00:01:46.215
"Not everybody is clever," said Mole.

22
00:01:46.216 --> 00:01:48.618
"Yes," agreed Rat.

23
00:01:48.619 --> 00:01:56.074
"But Toad, well . . . he thinks he is more clever than he is."

24
00:01:56.075 --> 00:02:01.239
The river curved as they rowed along.

25
00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:05.558
Suddenly a grand house came into sight.

26
00:02:05.559 --> 00:02:09.001
"There's Toad Hall!" said Rat.

27
00:02:09.002 --> 00:02:12.406
Rat rowed the boat to shore.

28
00:02:12.407 --> 00:02:16.808
They climbed out and walked to the house.

29
00:02:16.809 --> 00:02:21.279
Many boats were piled up on the grass.

30
00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:24.356
"Oh no," Rat said.

31
00:02:24.357 --> 00:02:26.867
"Toad is finished with boating.

32
00:02:26.868 --> 00:02:34.781
I wonder what he is up to now."
